From 28d6b649f5ed702498752ca1cfaa18d86f1f1836 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Johan Alvarado <contact@c127.dev>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 17:38:46 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] feat(linux): rkmpp encoder for Rockchip RK3588

Native encode device over h264_rkmpp/hevc_rkmpp. Wayland capture uses a
persistent ring of LINEAR buffers when the encoder is rkmpp; other
encoders keep the upstream capture path.
---
